01:03:05.874 --> 01:03:08.212
What happened that day?

931
01:03:09.351 --> 01:03:10.969
What's wrong with you?

932
01:03:11.069 --> 01:03:13.243
Suddenly someone comes up to you.

933
01:03:13.267 --> 01:03:15.165
- What?
- Has he moved out?

934
01:03:15.265 --> 01:03:16.883
Do you know where In Hyuk lives?

935
01:03:17.143 --> 01:03:18.242
Gampo-ri?

936
01:03:18.422 --> 01:03:21.918
Don't disturb adults, sit quietly.
I'm waiting for you.

937
01:03:22.098 --> 01:03:24.356
- Wait!
- The best days...

938
01:03:24.416 --> 01:03:28.507
I want to share my youth with you.

939
01:03:28.531 --> 01:03:30.709
I wish there was no tomorrow.

940
01:03:30.929 --> 01:03:32.468
I wish you wouldn't disappear.

941
